              "properties": {},
              "note": "# Server inputs\nThe nonce is the one the server issued. `Received MAC` defaults to the client workflow output for the default demo values. Change one bit to see `false`.\n\n> Learning example that explains the protocol. Do not use it in a real service. The keys are public demo keys.",
